Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.19,0:00:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.55,0:00:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the one who was with you got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I only need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.05,0:00:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you finally awake, Mikhail{**-kun}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you can sleep when we're finally headed to see our master!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited that I couldn't possible get a wink!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't stop thinking back to that scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.77,0:01:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.14,0:01:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That ends today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.57,0:01:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama}!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.77,0:01:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that you would come to greet us yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.34,0:01:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so very honored!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.78,0:01:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you, Mikhail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you lonely without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.35,0:01:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you speak to him like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.28,0:01:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, yes! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.81,0:01:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us proceed, Mikhail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.75,0:01:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,To the final hope of our race.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.47,0:02:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Ark of Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.53,0:03:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.02,0:03:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving to Karafuto at this time of year?\NWe must both not be right in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I could handle it if my family weren't with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.93,0:03:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's likely that Yevgraf is close to finding the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps he already has.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The ancient text?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:13.58,Default,,2,2,0,,The original was recovered several centuries ago from what are believed to be ruins of Sirius civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to decipher all of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but I did find information on the Ark of Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Things like what the Ark was and how it was passed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But by the time Yevgraf attacked Dogville,\Nsomeone had already taken it elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that with no lead as to where he went, they'd be stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems that they never gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think they finished deciphering the text?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And there was something in there that indicated where he took it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That seems most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume they replicated my methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Until now, I've thought of nothing but driving the vampires to extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.25,0:05:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I could atone for what I did to you and Dogville that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}South Karafuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yevgraf is waiting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As well as the Ark of Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little brother and that professor have been working as Jaegers. Quite a turn of events.{"To think that" would be fine if it weren't used earlier in the ep.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How was he? He must be about as tall as you now, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking me about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I ordered that all Jaegers be killed on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You had plenty of chances,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.31,0:05:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but you never pulled the trigger, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.89,0:06:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little brother must be very precious to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.72,0:06:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,An ancient syllabary that the Sirius once used.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.05,0:06:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sirius?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In the distant past, this land was home to a flourishing Sirius civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, then, this is hallowed ground to the Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.89,0:06:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, when your father spirited the Ark away, he took it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The writing on the walls says that this land is where the Ark of Sirius was born
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and the only place where it can be sealed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sealed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My father never said a word about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.67,0:06:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What, did he tell you that he'd come right back after he tucked the Ark away somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.90,0:07:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But your father never returned to Dogville.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.98,0:07:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are about to find out why, Mikhail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.45,0:07:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:21.99,Default,,2,2,0,,It would be no exaggeration to say that the choice your father made as the bearer of the Ark
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.99,0:07:26.19,Default,,2,2,0,,was an act that the Sirius would consider most heroic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:32.36,Default,,2,2,0,,If a human or any of our kind were to get any closer to it,\NI frankly don't know what would happen to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There is some kind of barrier here, powered by the Ark itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father created it in exchange for his own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad did?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,An eternal seal, unbreakable to all the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But as both a Sirius and his beloved son,\NI believe you may be the exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:08:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time for you to reunite with your father!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Somewhere in this land...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:32.16,Default,,2,2,0,,So you're telling us that Yuliy just left us to look for this\N"Ark of Sirius"? To southern Karafuto of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's never lacked for spunk.{i feel like there's a better way to express this but idk.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't need to just run off without telling us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.77,0:08:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Down, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.07,0:08:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep telling you not to mess with my hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, I never took him for a treasure hunter.\NWe don't even know what's in the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what's inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably just that discovering it has become his reason to live now.{He probably just thinks that discovering it\Nis what he's meant to do now. -- in the batch, if I were ambitious enough, I would try to rewrite the entire "reason to live" thing along these lines}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And he doesn't want us to have any part of it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.19,0:09:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor, should we really just leave Yuliy alone on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean he's strong, but I think this is too much for him to handle by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"We have our orders," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Philip!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Going back to Headquarters is more important than Yuliy, right?{i think this ups the petulance}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We have someplace to go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.41,0:09:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to do what only we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.73,0:09:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me know once you've decided on your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,'Scuse me, miss. Mind bringing me some sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.95,0:09:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't drink this much during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear it. I can't deal with this sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:09:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:09:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No reason to start flashing that around in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta say, you have some sharp eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This place has the tastiest food in south Karafuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.55,0:10:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. I'll treat you, so just don't start barking my head off,{"so you don't need to intimidate me like a dog does like that"}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.57,0:10:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy Jirov.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.66,0:10:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.07,0:10:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the same trade.{cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Both the Ark and Dad are resting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He gave his life in order to seal the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now I'm going to break that seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:11:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Hurry up and pull your beloved father out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.59,0:11:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With the Ark...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I get the Ark, then I can kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.67,0:11:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.78,0:11:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.73,0:11:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let me use... The Ark...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, Mikhail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.65,0:12:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.94,0:12:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be boring for you to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,interfere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H434343&\4c&H434343&}interfere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as obstinate a servant as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.91,0:12:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never once considered myself your servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.73,0:12:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The effect of the blood of the noble Sirius still running through your veins, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.03,0:12:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.71,0:13:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even that nobility cannot stand in the face of our blood pact!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.82,0:13:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it seems that pact has bought you the hatred of your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But how will your precious little brother fare, I wonder?{callback to previous conversation}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.17,0:13:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wiped out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.50,0:13:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All the other Jaegers were killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.77,0:13:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't look like that. I'm still alive, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But man, I can't believe I made a request for reinforcements and got just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.62,0:13:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.21,0:13:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't come here as a Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're after the Ark of Sirius, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.90,0:13:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're coworkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.41,0:14:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I usually end up hearing about everyone's history one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Including the fact that you're a remnant of the Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How much do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that the Ark exists at all.\NI found out when I was chasing Yevgraf.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This very evening, I'm planning on contacting someone who knows what happened to the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You want information on the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.31,0:14:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to find the Ark before Yevgraf does,\Nbreak it before his very eyes, and then break {\i1}him{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,For the most part, our interests are aligned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're suggesting we team up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It never hurts to have someone to trust your back to. {"you can never have too many people who can fight on your side."}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Ark is something precious to my race.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.41,0:14:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want it broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama}, you've returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.67,0:14:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.34,0:15:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So it didn't work after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama}, a moment please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no time to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If recovering the Ark is proving troublesome even with a Sirius,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,we have but one path left before us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.38,0:15:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time for the results of my grand research to prove...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To prove...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The destruction of the prototype was unfortunate,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but with your permission, I can start mass-production at any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.99,0:15:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama}, your orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama}...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.52,0:15:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear that I'll prove my research was worthwhile to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my research that will give vampires a future!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.01,0:16:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,On fall evening winds.{man, i'm just trying to make it poetic}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying from the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.25,0:16:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Strangers to this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Those people were like a typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.33,0:16:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully Ryouko will calm down a bit now that—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? You're too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I found this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.61,0:16:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dearest Father, I hope this finds you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.31,0:16:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My preparations being complete, I will now set out for London.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.19,0:16:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Father, your Ryouko must go on a trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please forgive me for leaving without telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.99,0:16:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Discovering the true nature of the disaster that befell our house is, I believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}my responsibility as the next head of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.22,0:16:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}By unrelenting effort and spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I swear to you I will finish this task and return to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.77,0:16:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Until that time comes, please stay well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.81,0:17:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,With love, Ryouko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.93,0:17:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"If you love your child, allow them their journeys," as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.88,0:17:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.02,0:17:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Need it be said?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.96,0:17:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,To London!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What was all that about allowing them their journeys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.40,0:17:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's ever said that you can't go with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Being sent to Karafuto this time of year smells like a demotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It feels like I'm between a rock and a hard place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How things turn from here depends entirely on the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.81,0:17:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to keep myself fed to stay well-fueled for this trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.56,0:18:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too cold for these old bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Winter's come early this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's really someone who knows about the Ark this deep in the mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's apparently an eccentric old recluse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.50,0:18:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He might not be willing to talk to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's your weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You fight with those sticks?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who taught you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your group's leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm self-taught.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.09,0:18:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's{\i0} not what I want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:19:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Professor taught me most everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.73,0:19:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How to read and write, all kinds of words, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How to kill vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure about a professor who'd teach crap like that to a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.15,0:19:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that we're going to end up fighting together at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you something before that happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.11,0:19:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask me a stupid question like "can you shoot," I'll whack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.19,0:19:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell the scent of blood on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.09,0:19:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The same smell that they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.43,0:19:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really a Jaeger?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When you do this job for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,their smell starts sticking to you permanently.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.32,0:19:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Some use cologne to hide it. I use my cigar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.53,0:19:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I always knew that I'd have to pay one day for killing so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't expect to have to pay the whole bill at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.23,0:20:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about how your team died?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.35,0:20:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.11,0:20:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent more time with them than my actual family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Same's true for you, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.91,0:20:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.41,0:20:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I came alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me, Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.72,0:20:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Larissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tamara.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.75,0:21:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Misha's little brother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.03,0:21:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look the same at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you become a vampire, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to play with Misha again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.43,0:21:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hate us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we killed all those villagers?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.13,0:21:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're the only Sirius left?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.23,0:21:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A Sirius?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your mom got killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But Misha got to be a vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.41,0:21:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If {*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama} hadn't bitten him, he woulda died!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yevgraf did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned {*}my brother{*Nii-san} into...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.79,0:21:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you lonely, Yuliy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be all right, Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.10,0:21:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just form a blood pact with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.35,0:23:32.16,Default,,2,2,0,,There may be more infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.16,0:23:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you hesitate?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.07,0:23:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to get your hands on the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to what Alexei did, nobody will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.51,0:23:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What are dads like?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.36,0:23:40.07,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and die!
